# Software Design Document: Analytics Dashboard Frontend (devbench-react-dashboard)

## 1. Executive Summary & Architectural Overview
The `devbench-react-dashboard` is a real-time analytics dashboard built using React 19, Tailwind CSS, and a resilient WebSocket client. It monitors system performance telemetry (CPU, Memory, Network I/O, Request Latency, Throughput, and Error Rates) streamed with low latency.

